{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_52_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"一、二十有三年，春，公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_52_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"二、祭叔來聘。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_52_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"其不言使何也？天子之內臣也。不正其外交，故不與使也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_52_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"三、夏，公如齊觀社。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_52_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"常事曰視，非常曰觀。觀，無事之辭也，以是為尸女也。無事不出竟。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_52_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"四、公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_52_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"公如往時，正也。致月，故也。如往月，致月，有懼焉爾。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_52_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"五、荊人來聘。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_52_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"善累而後進之。其曰人何也？舉道不待再。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_52_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"六、公及齊侯遇於穀。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_52_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"及者，內為志焉爾。遇者，志相得也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_52_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"七、蕭叔朝公。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_52_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"微國之君，未爵命者。其不言來，於外也。朝於廟，正也。於外，非正也。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_52_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"八、秋，丹桓宮楹。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_52_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"禮，天子、諸侯黝堊，大夫倉，士黈，丹楹，非禮也。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_52_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"九、冬，十有一月，曹伯射姑卒。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_52_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_52","textTraditional":"十、十有二月，甲寅，公會齊侯於扈。","sentenceOrder":17}],"overrides":{}}